              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 27:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Saulo yaagira ati: Nkashiisha; garuka, mwana wangye Daudi. Tindigaruka kukukora kubi, ahakuba amagara gangye gaaba ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gaawe eri izooba. Reeba, nkakora eby'obufa-mutima, naahaba munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yaamugira ati: Reeba eicumu ryawe ndiri, Nyakusinga! Hagire omwe aha batsigazi baawe, aije aryakiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.18.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 18:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA azimuurira omuntu nk'okuhikiirira kwe n'obwesigwa bwe oku biri. Omanye ku MUKAMA yaakuhayo omu mikono yangye eri izooba, nkanga kubanga omukono gwangye ahariiwe ou MUKAMA yaashukireho amajuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nk'oku amagara gaawe gaaba ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gangye eri izooba, n'agangye gabe nikwo gaaba ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, anjune omu kutuntuzibwa kwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
